plays.verse:
Viola:
I am not what I am,
A storm within my restless gale;

drafts.tidy:
Viola:
I am not what I am,
A storm within my restless gale;

Many a soul before dawn does weep,
Awake within the cool night’s embrace;
Against you I vow my heart to heed.
